    <item>
      <title>Pir 0.1.10</title>
      <sparkle:version>20261028.2</sparkle:version>
      <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.1.10</sparkle:shortVersionString>
      <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>13.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
      <pubDate>Wed, 28 Oct 2026 06:35:58 +0000</pubDate>
      <description>&lt;h2&gt;改进&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;新建文本贴屏时自动去除首尾空白与空行，保留正文内部排版，不修改系统剪贴板。已有贴图的编辑内容、会话恢复和再次贴上保持原样。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Improvements&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;New text pins trim leading and trailing whitespace and blank lines while preserving internal formatting and the original clipboard. Edited, restored and re-pinned content stays unchanged.&lt;/p&gt;
</description>
      <enclosure url="https://github.com/Caldis/Pir/releases/download/0.1.10/Pir.Versions.0.1.10-20261028.2.zip" length="6737689" type="application/octet-stream" sparkle:edSignature="y4YG66usWS8xgwxLK+vA8QsNJnUcsaFsdZJKCYs7oSybqVT+7tenWfzXY6cOAAJHGVYR42NSDPaZQhn58NQ+CA=="></enclosure>
    </item>
