    <item>
      <title>Pir 0.1.7</title>
      <sparkle:version>20261026.9</sparkle:version>
      <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.1.7</sparkle:shortVersionString>
      <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>13.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
      <pubDate>Mon, 26 Oct 2026 08:44:13 +0000</pubDate>
      <description>&lt;h2&gt;Pir 0.1.7&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;虚线边框的暗色对比仅向外侧扩散, 改善白底上的双线观感&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;窗内图片操作区增加左上留白, 窄窗口保持完整按钮布局&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;多文件网格为系统滚动条保留空间, 默认宽度保持三列&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;English&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Dashed frame contrast extends outward from the white stroke&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Image controls gain inset spacing and adapt to narrow windows&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;File grids account for scrollbar width and retain three columns at their default size&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
</description>
      <enclosure url="https://github.com/Caldis/Pir/releases/download/0.1.7/Pir.Versions.0.1.7-20261026.9.zip" length="6739412" type="application/octet-stream" sparkle:edSignature="oD7uScCOSAXWdSkE27NLe6aEgGY/Hr8TYjw4RJGEAyVerOSicDm4bo7NuTLhNOC2i4Z+DgCQQHqtgk/bweStAQ=="></enclosure>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>Pir 0.1.6</title>
      <sparkle:version>20261026.8</sparkle:version>
      <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.1.6</sparkle:shortVersionString>
      <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>13.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
      <pubDate>Mon, 26 Oct 2026 04:48:08 +0000</pubDate>
      <description>&lt;h2&gt;Pir 0.1.6&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;图片工具条采用均匀半透明圆角背景&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;图片显示模式切换采用连续尺寸过渡&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;fit 留白图片显示虚线边框&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;虚线边框增加紧贴轮廓的暗色对比, 改善白底和深底上的可见性&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;修复进入透明图片边缘时的缩放光标更新&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;English&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Image controls use a uniform translucent rounded background&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Image display modes transition through continuous resizing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Images with fit letterboxing show a dashed frame&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Dashed outlines gain a compact dark contrast treatment for light and dark backgrounds&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Resize cursors update when entering transparent image edges&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
</description>
      <enclosure url="https://github.com/Caldis/Pir/releases/download/0.1.6/Pir.Versions.0.1.6-20261026.8.zip" length="6729390" type="application/octet-stream" sparkle:edSignature="D9cOM1Lwfvz8CWCniRX/jFD+lIAsBf5r1IsK2yap9oEd/AnbF0A+nmTVdmlhG02ehPYTVwmgWfEhP18Bc9fDDg=="></enclosure>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>Pir 0.1.5</title>
      <sparkle:version>20261026.7</sparkle:version>
      <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.1.5</sparkle:shortVersionString>
      <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>13.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
      <pubDate>Mon, 26 Oct 2026 03:47:51 +0000</pubDate>
      <description>&lt;h2&gt;Pir 0.1.5&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;左侧工具条采用关闭、复原、缩放模式、复制顺序, 关闭按钮位于最左侧&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;复制成功时显示平滑过渡的勾选图标, 随后恢复复制按钮&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;图片支持裁剪填充与完整等比显示两种模式, 模式随会话保存&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;English&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Upper-left controls start with Close, followed by Restore, image scaling, and Copy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Successful copies show an animated checkmark before restoring the copy icon&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Image pins switch between cover and fit, with the selected mode saved across restarts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
</description>
      <enclosure url="https://github.com/Caldis/Pir/releases/download/0.1.5/Pir.Versions.0.1.5-20261026.7.zip" length="6721924" type="application/octet-stream" sparkle:edSignature="1hW7nYHS1pOG7e8FMIO79ZjxSs3s8tLrUmzAiVfm+bSVE17zkst9IOG8eWeA8r7VxXBgQseWb2KpQOfmIAoeBA=="></enclosure>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>Pir 0.1.4</title>
      <sparkle:version>20261026.6</sparkle:version>
      <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.1.4</sparkle:shortVersionString>
      <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>13.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
      <pubDate>Mon, 26 Oct 2026 02:59:25 +0000</pubDate>
      <description>&lt;h2&gt;Pir 0.1.4&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;修复贴屏移动后的尺寸、位置与显示器归属记忆&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;控制区移至左上, 优化透明图片边缘缩放、圆角阴影、虚线与悬停动画&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;文件贴屏支持相交框选、打开、废纸篓、简介与重命名, 文件引用跨浮窗同步&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;正式启动保持静默, 默认快捷键采用 Shift + Command + V&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;欢迎窗口居中, 开始按钮放大, 烟花位置随机且范围增大&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;English&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Reliable move and display placement persistence&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Upper-left controls, transparent edge resizing, rounded contrast backgrounds, and hover transitions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Finder-style file selection and actions with synchronized references&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Quiet release launches and a Shift + Command + V default shortcut&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Centered onboarding, a larger start button, and larger randomized fireworks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
</description>
      <enclosure url="https://github.com/Caldis/Pir/releases/download/0.1.4/Pir.Versions.0.1.4-20261026.6.zip" length="6708673" type="application/octet-stream" sparkle:edSignature="NWyV+8Dju5NdApbMdHnZPmULNeFVhEEyCv82RzkGcU2C8yTPQIcaZ2hg1thJ8UwfMF+pmRUyw3HRz62BfZFkCQ=="></enclosure>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>Pir 0.1.3</title>
      <sparkle:version>20261026.5</sparkle:version>
      <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.1.3</sparkle:shortVersionString>
      <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>13.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
      <pubDate>Mon, 26 Oct 2026 00:38:14 +0000</pubDate>
      <description>&lt;h2&gt;Pir 0.1.3&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;文件图标放大并紧凑排列, 窗口高度按内容适配&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;文本与文件浮窗采用毛玻璃背景, 文件浮窗隐藏复制按钮, 文本复制图标缩小&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;恢复悬停按钮的径向阴影, 透明图片保留虚线边界&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;贴屏页采用混合内容空态插图, 快捷键帮助按钮缩小, 状态栏图标与应用 Logo 一致&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt;Larger file icons with compact spacing and content-sized windows. Text and file pins use a translucent material. Refined hover controls, a mixed-content empty state, a smaller help button, and a menu bar icon matching the app logo.&lt;/p&gt;
</description>
      <enclosure url="https://github.com/Caldis/Pir/releases/download/0.1.3/Pir.Versions.0.1.3-20261026.5.zip" length="6587988" type="application/octet-stream" sparkle:edSignature="QHPG/vOBFyHTKhcoz7UhP9fTAJGoHsHciG3BILBPUXtOgAgEHKjjUSOq7iTQnPCi08qiDRVjS5/tA7GGFDuIDQ=="></enclosure>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>Pir 0.1.2</title>
      <sparkle:version>20261026.4</sparkle:version>
      <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.1.2</sparkle:shortVersionString>
      <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>13.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
      <pubDate>Mon, 26 Oct 2026 00:21:49 +0000</pubDate>
      <description>&lt;h2&gt;Pir 0.1.2&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;图片、可编辑文本和文件随手贴屏. 支持中英文、图标与列表文件视图、双击打开、原生文件拖拽和会话恢复.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Pin images, editable notes and files. Includes English and Chinese, file views, native drag and drop, persistent sessions and signed updates.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
      <enclosure url="https://github.com/Caldis/Pir/releases/download/0.1.2/Pir.Versions.0.1.2-20261026.4.zip" length="6578894" type="application/octet-stream" sparkle:edSignature="X3R659+mXQc8stfTy3WrKp/js+GbXkb8g7YXIqRNsyxElmxOw8nhysX0qF/Hm1HmLMinBzbADK+Px8eyw+0SDw=="></enclosure>
    </item>
